    {
      "description": "Shows internet reliability. Packet loss means some data never arrived. If loss > 2%, video calls and gaming can stutter.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 2,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(max(net_ping_loss_percent)) or on() vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Ping Loss",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "This panel explains what is happening in simple terms, what to watch for, and why it matters.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Read Me\nThis Grafana workspace monitors Anish's personal Mac with Prometheus + node_exporter.\n\nDashboards:\n- Mac System: Core Health \u2014 CPU, memory, disk usage (including AnishSSD + Time Machine), disk I/O\n- Mac Network: Connectivity & Wi\u2011Fi \u2014 throughput, errors/drops, ping health, Wi\u2011Fi signal/rates\n- Mac Info: Identity & Status \u2014 system identity, key specs, running launchd services\n- All Metrics: Live Explorer \u2014 all active Prometheus metrics (live only)\n\nRetention:\n- Prometheus data retention: 14 days\n- Storage cap: 20 GB\n\nExporters and launchd:\n- node_exporter (Homebrew service)\n- Custom exporters (launchd): net_connectivity, mac_system_info, launchd_metrics\n- Root daemon: wdutil_metrics for Wi\u2011Fi metrics\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Read Me",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "description": "Shows key identity facts like OS version, hardware model, CPU, memory, IP address, and Wi\u2011Fi name. Helpful for quick system overview without digging into system settings.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(mac_system_kv) or on() vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "title": "System Information",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {
            "valueLabel": "value"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "key": 0,
              "value": 1
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "description": "Shows how long the Mac has been running since the last restart. Useful for troubleshooting and confirming restarts.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
